{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C3\", \"C2\", \"C1\", \"C4\", \"C5\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C4\", \"C5\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C3\", \"C2\", \"C1\", \"C4\", \"C5\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C3\", \"C5\", \"C4\", \"C2\", \"C1\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C5\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\", \"C2\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C3的因果推进最完整，既解释了牵挂为何转成行动的力量，也让结尾落在松开绷劲、仍知道自己想护住什么的清醒上；C2内容更全，但首句过于拥挤，C1信息充足却略有重复，C4的收束很好但对快乐重新出现的来由交代不足，C5则因省略较多而显得单薄。keep：C2保留了最多实质内容，尤其写清行动与依恋不再互相排斥、快乐不能替代行动、愿望未成也不否定过去的快乐；C3次之，C1再后，C4漏掉怀疑和疲惫之后的快乐回返，C5还缺少不以一种满足遮住另一种需要等关键内容。cover：C3从退回安宁无法阻止损害，推进到带着牵挂行动、旧愿靠近、力量松开后仍有不确定性，最能解释珠子从宏大歌唱和迅疾冲势到回落、疑问与最终清醒的变化；C2对快乐与担忧的交替解释得同样充分，但结尾的松弛感不如C3明确，C1能说明愿望未实现和努力无保证，C4较好地照应了末尾的劲头退去，C5的段内变化则相对单薄。lean：C3几乎每条都推进了一个新的因果环节；C5短而直接，但省略了若干必要层次；C4对牵挂推动行动的作用略有重复；C2首尾都强调舍不得，且若干句子承载的心理步骤较多；C1还把相近的不确定感分散在多条中。plain：C5的怕眼前这一步伤到那种生活、舍不得不再像拖后腿，最像一个人在讲自己的事；C1的措辞也直接，但不把高兴当成保证略显总结化；C3的绷劲松下来很具体，不过有少量解释性措辞；C4的把眼前要做的事看成是在护住生活略偏概念化；C2有几处把心理认识解释得过于周全，读起来最像分析归纳。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ffe95b71-6ba0-4ce8-882e-f2faef82bcf4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T220537199259Z", "elapsed_seconds": 189.891, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:08:47.092163+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bcbd64ff694b6f71a1e32a1f9bb3711ab7c1fa9af93f09a61241934026e8c7c5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T220537199259Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ea242a3d0a2a282df15f8c1ada95a181494f82ac12d811ca6d039eee791770b2"}}}
